hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17368","Haddathana Sufyan, from Amr, he said akhbarani Abu al-Minhal, he heard Iyas ibn Abd al-Muzani, and he was from the companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he said: Do not sell water, for I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) forbidding selling water, Amr does not know which water it is."
